{"4754890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meowdventure", "steam_appid": 4754890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>About this game:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Meowdventure - is an Adventure RPG Game </strong>where As <strong>Phil</strong>, you <strong>must</strong> <strong>overcome</strong> all the <strong>obstacles, puzzles, enemies, </strong>in your path to return from a <strong>lucid dream</strong> back to <strong>reality</strong>! <strong>Explore</strong> all the <strong>corners of the Fluffy Universe</strong> and <strong>discover</strong> many <strong>secrets and mysteries.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Are you ready to dive into the strangest and most soulful dream of your life?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754890/extras/92f2c8979905c9700fae96df322c7223.poster.avif?t=1787337960\" width=846 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754890/extras/92f2c8979905c9700fae96df322c7223.webm?t=1787337960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754890/extras/92f2c8979905c9700fae96df322c7223.mp4?t=1787337960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Battle System:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your adventure will be hindered</i></strong><i> by various <strong>enemies and bosses!</strong> <strong>Attack, use items, do everything to defeat the enemy on your way!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https